<title>USA: Northstar Computer names Morin as CFO.</title>
<headline>Northstar Computer names Morin as CFO.</headline>
<dateline>BROOKLYN PARK, Minn. 1996-10-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Northstar Computer Forms  Inc said on Thursday it named Mary Ann Morin to the newly created position of chief financial officer and corporate secretary.</p>
<p>Morin previously served as controller and treasurer.</p>
<p>Northstar designs and manufactures custom business and financial forms.</p>
<p>	   -- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787</p>
